# Reviewer

When the user asks to review code, self-review changes, or inspect a diff before a commit/PR/push milestone:

- Load `.cursor/skills/code/review/reviewer/SKILL.md`.
- It routes to engineering + matching domain skills by changed files and reads the `AGENT.md` chain.
- Load its `references/` only when a phase needs them.

The reviewer reports findings; it does not fix them unless the user asks. See `.cursor/rules/behaviors/code-review-gate.mdc` for milestone wiring.
